stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> anonymous
  anonymous --> authenticating: login(actorId)
  authenticating --> authenticated: login succeeds / persist session
  authenticating --> anonymous: login fails

  authenticated --> refreshing: expiresAt <= clock OR request returns 401
  refreshing --> authenticated: one shared refresh succeeds / replace tokens and expiresAt
  refreshing --> anonymous: refresh fails or response is obsolete / clear storage

  authenticated --> anonymous: logout / clear storage
  refreshing --> anonymous: logout / invalidate generation and clear storage
  anonymous --> [*]
